  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "layer",
        "label": "Layer",
        "description": "Виртуальный фильтр по слою lakehouse. Все Spark-нагрузки в lab08 теперь идут через Spark Operator (SparkApplication CRD), но по lifecycle делятся на две группы:\n\n• Bronze — два long-running streaming SparkApplication-а: `bronze-s3-streaming`, `bronze-kafka-ingest`. Driver и executors живут постоянно, запускаются `make streaming-apps` (kubectl apply).\n• Silver — per-run batch SparkApplication `dbt-silver-<ts>`, который Airflow создаёт через `SparkKubernetesOperator` (task `dbt_silver` в `transactions_pipeline`). Driver живёт ~30–60с — выполняет `dbt run --select silver` и завершается.\n• Gold — два per-run SparkApplication-а: `dbt-gold-<ts>` (task `dbt_gold`) и `dbt-test-<ts>` (task `dbt_test`).\n\nПоэтому `$spark_app` для Silver/Gold будет содержать список запусков за выбранное время (по одному на каждый DAG-run, */30 cron). Большинство Spark-панелей показывают такие run-ы как короткие всплески — это норма.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "All : .*,Bronze : bronze-.*,Silver : dbt-silver-.*,Gold : dbt-gold-.*|dbt-test-.*",
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "All",
            "value": ".*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Bronze",
            "value": "bronze-.*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Silver",
            "value": "dbt-silver-.*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Gold",
            "value": "dbt-gold-.*|dbt-test-.*"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "layer_task",
        "label": "Layer task regex",
        "description": "Airflow task regex, синхронный с $layer. Для каждого слоя — свой набор task из transactions_pipeline DAG.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "All : .*,Bronze : wait_bronze.*,Silver : dbt_silver,Gold : dbt_gold|dbt_test",
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "All",
            "value": ".*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Bronze",
            "value": "wait_bronze.*"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Silver",
            "value": "dbt_silver"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "Gold",
            "value": "dbt_gold|dbt_test"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": ".*"
        },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "spark_app",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up{spark_app_name=~\"$layer\", spark_app_name!=\"\"}, spark_app_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "Spark App",
        "description": "Список Spark-драйверов, экспортирующих метрики через Prometheus servlet (port 4040). Сейчас здесь могут появиться следующие значения:\n• bronze-s3-streaming — Structured Streaming SparkApplication (bronze слой, постоянно)\n• bronze-kafka-ingest — Structured Streaming SparkApplication (bronze слой, постоянно)\n• dbt-silver-<ts>, dbt-gold-<ts>, dbt-test-<ts> — per-run dbt SparkApplication-ы (silver / gold), создаются Airflow-DAG-ом transactions_pipeline на каждый запуск.\nПри выборе Silver/Gold в $layer фильтр спрячет всё, кроме соответствующих dbt-* приложений."
      },
      {
        "name": "dag",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(airflow_dagrun_duration_success, dag)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "DAG"
      },
      {
        "name": "task",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(airflow_task_duration{dag=~\"$dag\", task=~\"$layer_task\"}, task)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "Task"
      },
      {
        "name": "bucket",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(minio_bucket_usage_total_bytes, bucket)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "label": "MinIO Bucket"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Pipeline health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Spark drivers up",
      "description": "count(up{spark_app_name=~\"$layer\", spark_app_name!=\"\"} == 1) — считаем только реальные Spark-драйверы (есть label spark_app_name). Без `spark_app_name!=\"\"` в подсчёт попадали бы все остальные up-цели кластера (apiserver, kubelet, minio, …) — у них spark_app_name отсутствует, а regex `.*` матчит и пустую строку.\n\n⚠️ Семантика разная по слоям:\n• Bronze — два long-running streaming SparkApplication-а, ожидаемо стабильно >=2.\n• Silver / Gold — per-run dbt SparkApplication-ы (dbt-silver/gold/test-<ts>), driver живёт 30–60с, поэтому большую часть времени here будет 0. Красный для Silver/Gold = норма, не инцидент.\n• All — обычно 2 (bronze) + краткие всплески до 5 во время dbt-runs.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up{spark_app_name=~\"$layer\", spark_app_name!=\"\"} == 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Scheduler heartbeat (per min)",
      "description": "rate(airflow_scheduler_heartbeat[5m]) * 60. Норма >=10. <5 = шедулер деградирует. Не зависит от $layer (общий компонент).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(airflow_scheduler_heartbeat[5m]) * 60",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "beats/min"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Failures (5m)",
      "description": "Сумма Airflow ti_failures + Spark Operator app failures за 5 минут. Один индикатор «есть ли инциденты». 0 = тишина, >=5 = инцидент. Аннотации failures видны на всех time series.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(sum(increase(airflow_ti_finish{state=\"failed\", task=~\"$layer_task\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) + (sum(increase(spark_application_failure_count[5m])) or vector(0))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "MinIO drives online %",
      "description": "sum(online)/sum(total)*100. 100 норма. <80 = тенант degraded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(minio_cluster_drive_online_total{job=\"minio\"}) / sum(minio_cluster_drive_total{job=\"minio\"}) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
